{% if chronicle %}
## chronicle (long-term memory, oldest first)
{% for entry in chronicle %}
- {{ entry }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
## recent events
{% if recent_events %}
{% for event in recent_events %}
- {{ event }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
_no prior events._
{% endif %}

## 🗺️ active quests
{% for q in quests %}
- **{{ q.id }}** — {{ q.title }} _(status: {{ q.status }})_
  - {{ q.description }}
  - owner: {{ q.owner }}
{% if q.plan %}
  - plan:
{% for step in q.plan %}
    {{ '→ current: ' if loop.index0 == q.current_step else ('- done: ' if loop.index0 < q.current_step else '- ') }}{{ step }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if interventions.get(q.id) %}
  - this is intervention #{{ interventions[q.id] + 1 }} on this thread — escalate stakes on the existing thread rather than introducing a new sidetrack.
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if interventions.get('world') %}
- untargeted interventions so far: {{ interventions['world'] }} — prefer tying this one to a quest above.
{% endif %}

{% if factions %}
## 🕰️ faction agendas (off-screen — good sources of pressure)
{% for f in factions %}
- **{{ f.name }}**: {{ f.goal }}
{% for clock in f.clocks %}
  - {{ clock.name }}: {{ 'already happened — ' ~ clock.consequence if clock.consequence_triggered else clock.progress ~ '/' ~ clock.segments ~ ' toward: ' ~ clock.consequence }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## 🎬 scene
- location: {{ location_id }}
{% if scene %}
- description: {{ scene.description or 'no description' }}
- features: {{ scene.features | join(', ') if scene.features else 'none' }}
- items: {{ scene.items | join(', ') if scene.items else 'none' }}
- exits: {{ scene.connections | join(', ') if scene.connections else 'none' }}
{% endif %}
{% if present %}
- people here:
{% for character in present %}
  - **{{ character.id }}**{% if character.role %} ({{ character.role }}){% endif %}: {{ character.stats.hp }}/{{ character.stats.max_hp }} HP; wants {{ character.goal or 'nothing specific' }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
- people here: no one
{% endif %}

---

Call `report` with exactly one complication grounded in the state above. Use a concrete scene detail or present character's motivation when possible, and leave the characters more than one plausible way to respond.
